# Commit Messages

Используй **Conventional Commits**:

```
[<type>] <description>

[optional body]
[optional footer]
```

**Types:** `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`

**Примеры:**
- `[feat] add reorder support`
- `[fix] correct token refresh logic`
- `[refactor] extract expense entity`
